---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---
<PageLayout title="Non math" description="Non math — Arye Deutsch">
  <h1 class="page-title">Non math</h1>

  <div class="grid-2col">
    <div class="non-math-text">
      <p>Besides mathematics, I lead a career program within the Effective Altruism community designed to help individuals find high-impact career paths. Additionally, I've translated several EA articles, mentored various EA activities, and taken <a href="https://www.givingwhatwecan.org/pledge" target="_blank">The Pledge</a>. Over the past years, I have been active in supporting Palestinians by helping and providing protective presence against violence, and participating in other activities along these lines.</p>

      <p>Occasionally, I enjoy playing video games. Some of my top favorites include<br/>
      <strong>Outer Wilds</strong> <span class="text-small">(highly recommended for researchers; avoid spoilers before playing)</span>,<br/>
      Celeste,<br/>
      Braid,<br/>
      The Witcher,<br/>
      Hollow Knight,<br/>
      Nier Automata,<br/>
      Slay the Spire.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="non-math-main-photo">
      <img src="/images/non-math/recovered/climbing.jpg" alt="Arye climbing" class="img-cover" />
    </div>
  </div>

  <p>Of course, I also like hiking and climbing (Do I even have a choice?) along with photography. Here are a few of my pictures:</p>

  <div class="photo-gallery" aria-label="Selected photography">
    <div class="photo-gallery-row photo-gallery-row--8-4">
      <img src="/images/non-math/recovered/01-mountain.jpg" alt="Mountain ridge beneath a cloudy sky" loading="lazy" />
      <img src="/images/non-math/recovered/02-grape-hyacinth.jpg" alt="Purple grape hyacinths" loading="lazy" />
    </div>

    <div class="photo-gallery-row photo-gallery-row--5-7">
      <img src="/images/non-math/recovered/03-dragonfly.jpg" alt="Red dragonfly perched on a stem" loading="lazy" />
